            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nFantastic Thai in Hanoi\nNov 2018 • Couples\nI've been to the Giang Vo location a number of times but this was my first time here. I cannot get over how delicious Bangkok Thai Kitchen is. My massaman curry was phenomenal with the perfect sweetness and without so many potatoes that they overwhelmed the dish. The chicken and rice perfectly absorbed the amazing sauce. I know that I often say that I plan to return to places...but I actually already have plans to go back next week!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 23, 2018",
